the error.\r\nI also did it to warning start and end lines since this could also happen with warnings, like a Line 1 UNTYPED_DECLARATION warning gives an error for line -1.\r\n\r\nI also fixed some edge cases in the warning highlighting logic.\r\nIf only the end of a warning is folded, the start of it is now still highlighted. This can happen with a missing tool warning and a function at the end of the file.\r\nIf only the start of the warning is folded, the end is highlighted as well as now the folded line. This can happen with a multiline string that isn't indented.\r\nThe last line of a multiple line highlight is now highlighted, since it is should be considered inclusive. This can be seen with multiline strings and untyped functions.\r\n\r\n`get_folded_line_header` returns the same line if it is already unfolded, so I also simplified the logic a bit.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","l